  "notes": "SessionSifu 3.5.4 makes Recall capture and search substantially lighter: unchanged captures skip OCR, duplicate images reuse encrypted OCR, CPU-heavy work and thumbnails are bounded in background workers, process/accessibility discovery is cached, KDE uses batched KWin requests and GNOME tracking is event-driven."
